  "content": {
    "prompt": "Write Python code that sets n to 7. If n multiplied by 2 is greater than 15, add 3 to n and store it back. Otherwise, subtract 2 from n and store it back. Then, in a separate if statement, if n is greater than 8, multiply n by 2 and store it back. Print the final value of n.",
    "source_code": "n = 7\nif n * 2 > 15:\n    n = n + 3\nelse:\n    n = n - 2\nif n > 8:\n    n = n * 2\nprint(n)\n"
  },
